    <!--
        Folder shape: rounded-rectangle body (corner r=60) with a tab in
        the upper-left.  The tab's right edge is a diagonal cut; both tab
        corners are properly rounded (r≈28) using well-formed quadratic
        bezier curves whose start/end points sit on the incoming edges.

        Clockwise from bottom-left of body:
          body bottom-right corner  (r=60)
          body top-right corner     (r=60)
          diagonal cut → tab top-right corner  (Q with control at corner)
          tab top edge → tab top-left corner   (r=28)
          left side down → body bottom-left corner (r=60)
    -->
